00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:21.880
My co-director is Leila Kinney.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:26.260
And I also want to thank Liz
Murphy who produced this event,

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:30.730
and Anya Ventura who did a
lot of the writing to generate

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:33.790
interest to get you here.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.550
It's been an incredibly
interesting and busy week

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.450
for Tomas.

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:41.440
I can't imagine he has
anything left to say,

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.870
but we're going to make him talk
for a couple of hours anyway.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.860
Just briefly, you've been seeing
