00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.210
we have coming up in the spring.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.730
I hope that you will
take note of these

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:56.740
and that we'll see you
for some or many of them.

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.200
I would just now
like to introduce

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.950
