the constellation.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.790
Somehow you step like
this, and then you're all,

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.520
I mean, in the South hemisphere
you say three Marias,

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:33.350
and it kind of start to wrinkle.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:38.210
I mean, there is a kind of
pretty much immersion, somehow.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.610
And there is,
somehow also, let's

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:43.130
try to maybe read this
kind of reverberation

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:46.220
