00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:12.570
That kind of engaging, that
kind of situational insight,

00:24:12.570 --> 00:24:16.190
and how we might confront
with another scenario which

00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:19.970
have more maybe latent concern.

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:23.150
But nevertheless,
I mean, to go back,

00:24:23.150 --> 00:24:29.305
I'm kind of enthusiastic to
try to think that this might

00:24:29.305 --> 00:24:30.680
be one of the
clouds, or might be

00:24:30.680 --> 00:24:35.810
one of the ideas of how we might
be able to shape or to think

00:24:35.810 --> 00:24:37.110
