00:24:37.110 --> 00:24:40.220
And I also, to
expand, [INAUDIBLE]..

00:24:40.220 --> 00:24:43.110
We are on a spaceship Earth,
spinning around the sun.

00:24:43.110 --> 00:24:46.070
And all the time, there
is this kind of idea

00:24:46.070 --> 00:24:49.520
to expand the concept of
thinking like a cloud city

00:24:49.520 --> 00:24:51.080
on kind of multiple scales.

00:24:51.080 --> 00:24:54.680
And but also go back to
the interpretation of what

00:24:54.680 --> 00:24:58.750
might be, where they might be.

00:24:58.750 --> 00:25:01.250
But basically, what I'm
thinking very easily,

00:25:01.250 --> 00:25:04.970
