00:25:07.790 --> 00:25:09.470
That we would say,
because I mean,

00:25:09.470 --> 00:25:12.300
my first question will
be, is it possible that

00:25:12.300 --> 00:25:15.320
to kind of an
architectural scale?

00:25:15.320 --> 00:25:18.890
Or kind of, I just borrowed the
classification of the clouds

00:25:18.890 --> 00:25:20.738
