00:25:30.680 --> 00:25:33.170
I mean, the question that I
posed [INAUDIBLE] was saying,

00:25:33.170 --> 00:25:36.840
like, could we imagine
that if cities are built,

00:25:36.840 --> 00:25:40.580
let's say each of these
[? fields ?] is a house,

00:25:40.580 --> 00:25:44.090
and then we can kind of
agglomerate one to each other.

00:25:44.090 --> 00:25:46.910
It's kind of a big
mobility of cities.

00:25:46.910 --> 00:25:51.170
It might resemble clouds
as we see them today.

00:25:51.170 --> 00:25:54.830
Does it mean it might move
these particles in a certain way

00:25:54.830 --> 00:25:58.640
if we have neutral
buoyancy that somehow

00:25:58.640 --> 00:26:00.560
may form as the clouds form.

00:26:00.560 --> 00:26:02.060
Based, also, on the
decision that we

00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:05.300
might have that we want to be
[? neighborhood ?] on the way

00:26:05.300 --> 00:26:07.430
from here to South
America and then back,

00:26:07.430 --> 00:26:09.390
you know, that we can
choose the path somehow.

00:26:09.390 --> 00:26:10.848
And then we said,
like, maybe there

00:26:10.848 --> 00:26:13.460
are some small chamber that we
can drive with some particle,

00:26:13.460 --> 00:26:16.190
and see if this simulation
of this kind of understanding

00:26:16.190 --> 00:26:21.110
