which goes to Venice.

00:52:08.970 --> 00:52:11.700
And the black widow have
a kind of configuration

00:52:11.700 --> 00:52:14.010
which somehow have kind
of very [INAUDIBLE]..

00:52:14.010 --> 00:52:17.700
I mean, all the [INAUDIBLE]
because we put the black widow

00:52:17.700 --> 00:52:19.050
upside down how we present it.

00:52:19.050 --> 00:52:22.230
Anyway, to see how spiders
are always, you know,

00:52:22.230 --> 00:52:24.810
we have a kind of internal
discourse or dispute

00:52:24.810 --> 00:52:27.390
about why the spider is
presented the opposite.

00:52:27.390 --> 00:52:32.220
But first was, you know,
let's choose a type of spider

00:52:32.220 --> 00:52:35.880
who the geometry also will
allow people to walk through.

00:52:35.880 --> 00:52:38.850
And somehow will get entangled
somehow, but also it move.

00:52:38.850 --> 00:52:41.910
Does this mean the decision
in that case was together

00:52:41.910 --> 00:52:44.970
with Peter Jaeger.

00:52:44.970 --> 00:52:47.640
Then this decision of
the material each--

00:52:47.640 --> 00:52:49.710
Did the spider
determine the geometry,

00:52:49.710 --> 00:52:54.160
or did you edit and
editorialize some of it?

00:52:54.160 --> 00:52:55.650
No, we have many.

00:52:55.650 --> 00:52:58.297
I mean, we have,
maybe, 15 or 20 boxes.

00:52:58.297 --> 00:52:59.880
Does this mean in
some moment, yes, we

00:52:59.880 --> 00:53:01.680
decided which one was
the more beautiful.

00:53:01.680 --> 00:53:03.420
I mean, completely conscious.

00:53:03.420 --> 00:53:06.000
And then also, when we try
to mix these hybrid spider,

00:53:06.000 --> 00:53:08.700
or make spider collaborate
on one web on top

00:53:08.700 --> 00:53:11.310
of the other web,
also, we say, oh, I

00:53:11.310 --> 00:53:13.540
mean, let's start for
something more simple.

00:53:13.540 --> 00:53:16.260
And then hopefully, the next,
we can make small hybrid.

00:53:16.260 --> 00:53:18.130
But also was very complicated.

00:53:18.130 --> 00:53:20.130
I mean, it was trial and
error, trial and error.

00:53:20.130 --> 00:53:22.505
You know, it's like at least
the Black Widow, I think so,

00:53:22.505 --> 00:53:25.860
I have seven different
types of threads.

00:53:25.860 --> 00:53:27.698
One which is more
elastic, the other one who

00:53:27.698 --> 00:53:28.740
have their configuration.

00:53:28.740 --> 00:53:30.630
And was very complicated, too.

00:53:30.630 --> 00:53:32.160
I mean, all the
threads, we will do

00:53:32.160 --> 00:53:34.860
a system which is too flexible.

00:53:34.860 --> 00:53:36.270
Was very difficult to calibrate.

00:53:36.270 --> 00:53:39.600
This mean we make all the
lines are non-elastic.

00:53:39.600 --> 00:53:42.062
But the nodes, and when
