00:53:42.062 --> 00:53:44.520
This means it gives some kind
of flexibility to the system,

00:53:44.520 --> 00:53:48.000
still, to kind of
have this ability

00:53:48.000 --> 00:53:51.810
to keep the nodes in the space.

00:53:51.810 --> 00:53:55.460
It was very interesting that
you showed us the process

00:53:55.460 --> 00:54:00.300
