00:54:08.680 --> 00:54:16.620
there's the desire of managing
the uncertainty of everything

00:54:16.620 --> 00:54:17.370
that happens.

00:54:17.370 --> 00:54:19.740
Not to really manipulate.

00:54:19.740 --> 00:54:23.250
And also, it seems
