taking pictures.

00:54:51.720 --> 00:54:54.000
And finally, when
you go and work.

00:54:54.000 --> 00:54:54.510
Yeah.

00:54:54.510 --> 00:54:56.400
Oh, I mean, it's
like I mean what

00:54:56.400 --> 00:55:00.180
I start is like a
kind of a, I mean,

00:55:00.180 --> 00:55:01.920
when you talk with
our [INAUDIBLE],,

00:55:01.920 --> 00:55:04.920
you say, hey, I want to build
a spider web because I'm

00:55:04.920 --> 00:55:06.270
interested in the universe.

00:55:06.270 --> 00:55:08.565
And then I show the
Millennium simulation

00:55:08.565 --> 00:55:10.440
that [? I acknowledge that ?]
I couldn't find

00:55:10.440 --> 00:55:12.210
