00:55:12.210 --> 00:55:13.750
You know, like, I
have nothing to do

00:55:13.750 --> 00:55:17.610
this analogy that others,
yes, give it for granted.

00:55:17.610 --> 00:55:22.832
But at the same time, you know,
I come my way saying, hey,

00:55:22.832 --> 00:55:23.790
but let's try it first.

00:55:23.790 --> 00:55:26.310
Because you are saying that's
not similar, but actually,

00:55:26.310 --> 00:55:29.270
you never even scan
