00:55:35.343 --> 00:55:38.880
And I kind of maybe explain
you, again, in a kind of.

00:55:38.880 --> 00:55:40.020
But I will never put it.

00:55:40.020 --> 00:55:41.940
I mean, once again,
it's like I'm not

00:55:41.940 --> 00:55:45.690
interested to say, oh, I explain
to you in a scientific matter.

00:55:45.690 --> 00:55:47.970
Or I just explain to you
