00:55:47.970 --> 00:55:51.840
I think is what unified us is
this passion, this curiosity,

00:55:51.840 --> 00:55:52.425
this interest.

00:55:52.425 --> 00:55:53.550
It's like, oh, let's do it.

00:55:53.550 --> 00:55:55.440
I don't care in the
way how I do it.

00:55:55.440 --> 00:55:58.620
[INAUDIBLE] don't
ask myself how I do.

00:55:58.620 --> 00:56:01.440
That's what I think should
kind of blur disciplines, also.

00:56:01.440 --> 00:56:05.130
And blur the wish
of doing something.

00:56:05.130 --> 00:56:06.000
I don't know.

00:56:06.000 --> 00:56:07.870
That's as I find it, somehow.

00:56:07.870 --> 00:56:08.370
Yeah.

00:56:08.370 --> 00:56:12.690
But in that blur, you're
proposing new ways

00:56:12.690 --> 00:56:15.660
