00:57:10.950 --> 00:57:14.340
You know, it's like, I don't
know what the hell is space,

00:57:14.340 --> 00:57:15.180
somehow.

00:57:15.180 --> 00:57:17.340
And I don't know how
many damn dimension you

00:57:17.340 --> 00:57:21.570
