and expanding my imagination

00:57:21.570 --> 00:57:24.120
to try, somehow, to
not even to translate,

00:57:24.120 --> 00:57:28.080
but I think so to build together
kind of an imaginary capability

00:57:28.080 --> 00:57:34.890
to expand also, the way
how we see the things.

00:57:34.890 --> 00:57:37.500
And I think there is a lot of
influence, also, of the things

00:57:37.500 --> 00:57:40.770
