00:57:46.170 --> 00:57:48.330
But for example, space
in the membranes,

00:57:48.330 --> 00:57:50.640
not on these kind of
brains or whatever

00:57:50.640 --> 00:57:54.360
we want to use more
this cosmic scale.

00:57:54.360 --> 00:57:56.580
It doesn't exist.

00:57:56.580 --> 00:57:58.630
Again, this lasagna,
