it to the other side.

00:58:38.100 --> 00:58:39.660
I mean, what the hell is space?

00:58:39.660 --> 00:58:42.170
You know.

00:58:42.170 --> 00:58:43.650
I don't know.

00:58:43.650 --> 00:58:49.605
But it's a pure negotiation
