00:58:49.605 --> 00:58:50.730
The other one who's on top.

00:58:50.730 --> 00:58:52.870
The other one who
forgot the door open.

00:58:52.870 --> 00:58:54.360
Because this is
what had happened.

00:58:54.360 --> 00:58:57.210
Somehow you learn,
OK, that is space

00:58:57.210 --> 00:58:58.680
