00:58:58.680 --> 00:59:02.140
That's something which, I
love the analogy to say,

00:59:02.140 --> 00:59:05.040
invent all kind of
whatever architecture is.

00:59:05.040 --> 00:59:07.650
But to try to kind
of promote this idea,

00:59:07.650 --> 00:59:11.190
