influence the way you move.

00:59:27.930 --> 00:59:29.560
And how you move I move.

00:59:29.560 --> 00:59:30.960
And I don't know.

00:59:30.960 --> 00:59:33.397
That's something
which, the space

00:59:33.397 --> 00:59:35.370
