with each other somehow.

00:59:38.130 --> 00:59:38.940
Maybe I get lost.

00:59:38.940 --> 00:59:40.273
I don't know what I want to say.

00:59:40.273 --> 00:59:41.970
But maybe it was
something [INAUDIBLE]..

00:59:41.970 --> 00:59:46.890
Are you willing, at
any cost, to fulfill

00:59:46.890 --> 00:59:53.160
