01:00:11.190 --> 01:00:12.005
And I think so.

01:00:12.005 --> 01:00:13.380
And all the
materials that I use,

01:00:13.380 --> 01:00:16.208
somehow, they have
a kind of, and I

01:00:16.208 --> 01:00:18.000
know the stone and kind
of $1 billion years

01:00:18.000 --> 01:00:19.110
will change as an elastic.

01:00:19.110 --> 01:00:23.490
But you know, for
example, the materials

01:00:23.490 --> 01:00:28.110
